    "detailed_description": "TWIST ON SCREEN OR IN VR<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNominated for RuffTalkVR 'AppLab Game Of The Year'<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTWISTEX is a falling block puzzle game with a 'twist'. It combines classic gameplay with original new mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCLEAR RINGS, COLORS AND LEVELS<br />\r\nClear 48 levels across 2 distinct game types, or see how long you can last in endless mode with 3 difficulties.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEEL THE PRESSURE<br />\r\nAs the blocks get higher, so does the pressure. Try to keep your cool as the music and environment react to how you're doing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUNLOCK AND CUSTOMIZE<br />\r\nClearing levels will unlock new towers, blocks, music and environments, for you to customize your experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLEADERBOARDS<br />\r\nCompete for the top spot, or beat your friends, in the online leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVR OR NO<br />\r\nPlay the non-VR version with a controller, keyboard or mouse, with plenty of options to suit your playstyle.<br />\r\nThe VR version is a whole different experience, with motion controls made especially for VR.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the Discord server to get involved or follow the socials for the latest updates.",
